WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:42.920
I heard Mr. Shen's wife

01:43.000 --> 01:44.800
was Huaixiang's most talented lady,

01:45.400 --> 01:48.920
so I got curious and went to take a look.

01:49.000 --> 01:49.960
Indeed.

01:50.040 --> 01:51.880
Mrs. Shen has a unique face.

01:52.360 --> 01:53.880
It was rare indeed.

01:54.440 --> 01:56.640
That's why I was shocked

01:56.720 --> 01:58.840
when I saw Ms. Jiang Li.

02:01.520 --> 02:03.440
Because she looks exactly the same

02:04.160 --> 02:05.840
as Xue Fangfei.

02:12.120 --> 02:13.560
Your Majesty,

02:13.640 --> 02:14.840
have you ever heard

02:14.920 --> 02:16.880
of two people who are not related

02:16.960 --> 02:19.120
but look exactly alike?

02:19.200 --> 02:21.080
If a family of three
were coincidentally killed

02:21.160 --> 02:22.640
at the same time,

02:23.440 --> 02:27.120
it's not much of a coincidence
that two people look the same.

02:27.200 --> 02:29.080
I just feel sorry for Ms. Jiang Li,

02:29.160 --> 02:30.960
who lived in Zhennv Hall for ten years.

02:31.640 --> 02:34.320
When she was about to return
to Jiang Residence,

02:34.400 --> 02:37.280
she was brutally murdered by someone.

02:37.360 --> 02:40.760
I'm afraid even Ms. Jiang Li's father,
the Chief Secretariat,

02:40.840 --> 02:43.040
is in the dark.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.520
Your Highness,

02:44.600 --> 02:45.720
what do you mean by that?

02:46.280 --> 02:47.360
Please make it clear.

02:47.440 --> 02:49.640
How could a woman
who spent ten years in Zhennv Hall

02:49.720 --> 02:51.480
since she was eight years old

02:51.560 --> 02:52.760
outperform noble descendants

02:52.840 --> 02:55.920
in the capital
and get first place in the Annual Exam

02:56.000 --> 02:58.280
without being educated?

02:58.360 --> 03:00.400
There are so many miserable people
in the world.

03:00.480 --> 03:03.200
Why did Ms. Jiang Li do everything

03:03.280 --> 03:06.200
to save Xue Huaiyuan at all costs?

03:06.280 --> 03:07.960
The only explanation

03:08.760 --> 03:10.560
for all this

03:11.280 --> 03:12.560
is that you're not Jiang Li.

03:13.200 --> 03:14.600
You're Xue Fangfei.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.640
That's a crime of deceiving His Majesty.

03:23.720 --> 03:24.560
Yes.

03:24.640 --> 03:25.960
It's a crime of deceiving His Majesty.

03:26.880 --> 03:27.880
That's a serious offense.

03:27.960 --> 03:30.040
- Yes, how dare she deceive His Majesty?
- How dare she?

03:31.720 --> 03:32.720
Your Highness,

03:33.560 --> 03:35.600
if I'm the Xue Fangfei you say I am,

03:36.240 --> 03:39.680
how could the people of Huaixiang
who followed me to the capital not know?

03:40.240 --> 03:42.000
Xue Fangfei grew up in Huaixiang,

03:42.080 --> 03:43.600
so they'd recognize her.

03:44.320 --> 03:46.560
Your Highness can send someone to ask

03:46.640 --> 03:49.880
if I'm Xue Fangfei or Jiang Li.

03:50.440 --> 03:53.000
Those who came to the capital with you
to petition to His Majesty

03:53.080 --> 03:54.960
must have conspired with you in advance.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.920
If you don't mind me torturing them,

03:57.000 --> 03:59.240
I'll give it a try.

03:59.320 --> 04:01.080
Those who dared to come to the capital
to petition to His Majesty

04:01.160 --> 04:02.840
have already disregarded their safety.

04:03.880 --> 04:05.040
Does Your Highness

04:05.120 --> 04:06.720
want them to suffer again?

04:06.800 --> 04:08.200
Look at this, everyone.

04:08.880 --> 04:10.560
She's still protecting
the people of Huaixiang.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.640
Your Majesty,

04:12.720 --> 04:14.280
the people of Huaixiang and I

04:14.840 --> 04:16.399
have gone to great lengths

04:16.480 --> 04:18.600
to save a good official from injustice.

04:19.279 --> 04:20.640
I don't know

04:20.720 --> 04:23.120
how my looks offended Her Highness

04:23.200 --> 04:25.000
that she insists

04:25.480 --> 04:27.280
on using a deceased person

04:27.360 --> 04:28.560
to doom me to death.

04:29.080 --> 04:32.480
Ms. Jiang Li, you're really good

04:33.080 --> 04:34.840
at making false countercharges.

04:35.440 --> 04:38.480
But I'm not interested
in whether you live or die.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.200
I just feel bad for the Chief Secretariat,

04:40.280 --> 04:41.120
Vice Director Ye,

04:41.760 --> 04:45.360
and those you fooled.

04:45.440 --> 04:46.720
Especially His Majesty.

04:47.240 --> 04:50.080
It's touching to see such compassion

04:50.160 --> 04:51.520
towards a good official.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.720
It's a pity that in the end,

04:53.360 --> 04:55.200
His Majesty was just being used.

04:58.080 --> 05:00.560
Xue Huaiyuan's case
has just been cleared up.

05:01.640 --> 05:04.200
Everything I said was true.

05:04.280 --> 05:06.800
I wonder how Your Highness got the idea

05:06.880 --> 05:08.120
that His Majesty was being used.

05:10.680 --> 05:11.680
Or

05:12.520 --> 05:14.800
where did you hear

05:14.880 --> 05:17.440
such a ridiculous claim
that I'm Xue Fangfei?

05:20.240 --> 05:21.560
Be patient.

05:23.320 --> 05:25.640
I'll let you meet
your old acquaintance in a minute.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.240
Minister Zhou,

05:29.320 --> 05:31.640
summon my witness too.

05:35.080 --> 05:36.800
Summon the witness.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.760
Greetings, Your Majesty.

05:51.520 --> 05:52.520
Who is this?

05:53.160 --> 05:55.120
This is Shou Zhen,
the Chief of Zhennv Hall,

05:55.200 --> 05:57.280
where Ms. Jiang Li stayed for ten years.

05:57.800 --> 06:01.360
Although Shou Zhen was severely punished
by Your Majesty for having an affair,

06:01.440 --> 06:04.320
Ms. Jiang Li's deceiving you

06:04.400 --> 06:05.640
is still a big deal.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.760
That's why

06:07.840 --> 06:10.080
I borrowed Shou Zhen from prison.

06:10.680 --> 06:14.160
And I found out something interesting
when I did that.

06:14.800 --> 06:17.920
I wonder who made some underhanded moves

06:18.000 --> 06:19.960
and transferred Shou Zhen

06:20.040 --> 06:22.400
to a prison that's far away in Hui City.

06:22.480 --> 06:23.640
I put in

06:24.200 --> 06:26.480
a lot of effort to find her.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.520
But there's no rush.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.640
We can look into it later.

06:32.640 --> 06:35.800
Identifying the person
is the priority now.

06:38.200 --> 06:39.400
Shou Zhen,

06:39.480 --> 06:40.760
look carefully.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.480
Is this person Jiang Li?

06:44.600 --> 06:45.480
Your Majesty,

06:46.840 --> 06:49.800
she is definitely not Jiang Li.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.440
Look carefully.

06:52.520 --> 06:54.160
If you talk nonsense,

06:54.240 --> 06:55.640
I'll cut out your tongue.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.520
I watched Jiang Li grow up

06:59.160 --> 07:01.120
from the age of 8 to 18.

07:01.200 --> 07:04.920
I'd recognize her
even if she turned into ashes.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.240
She

07:06.320 --> 07:07.680
is not Jiang Li.

07:08.720 --> 07:10.240
If that's true,

07:10.320 --> 07:11.800
where is Jiang Li?

07:11.880 --> 07:15.040
I'm afraid we'll have
to ask Ms. Xue about that.

07:18.360 --> 07:19.360
Chief,

07:19.440 --> 07:21.000
you say I'm not Jiang Li.

07:21.760 --> 07:23.960
So where's the real Jiang Li?

07:24.040 --> 07:25.240
You

07:26.560 --> 07:27.720
killed her.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.800
- Did she really do that?
- All right.

07:30.880 --> 07:31.960
If it's true

07:32.560 --> 07:34.520
that I killed the real Jiang Li,

07:35.320 --> 07:37.040
how did I kill her?

07:37.600 --> 07:39.280
And where is her body?

07:39.840 --> 07:41.200
You killed her.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.520
You've already disposed of her body.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.480
Of course I don't know.

07:45.560 --> 07:48.200
I was the one who met her
when Mrs. Liu went to Zhennv Hall.

07:48.760 --> 07:50.440
Why didn't you expose me then?

07:50.520 --> 07:52.400
I was confused

07:52.880 --> 07:54.320
because you offered

07:55.000 --> 07:57.840
to help me get away when you became

07:57.920 --> 07:58.880
Ms. Jiang Li.

07:59.600 --> 08:02.920
That's why I helped you cover up the lie.

08:03.000 --> 08:05.640
So this is why you came to slander me.

08:05.720 --> 08:06.840
What?

08:07.400 --> 08:08.680
I'm slandering you?

08:09.240 --> 08:11.120
You're really good
at making false countercharges.

08:12.880 --> 08:13.720
Your Majesty,

08:14.280 --> 08:16.440
the Chief of Zhennv Hall
is morally unsound

08:16.520 --> 08:17.920
and had an affair,

08:18.000 --> 08:20.080
so such a person's words
are not to be trusted.

08:20.160 --> 08:23.320
Now, someone must have offered

08:23.400 --> 08:24.880
to exonerate her

08:24.960 --> 08:26.000
by slandering me.

08:26.080 --> 08:27.560
I beg Your Majesty to look into this.

08:27.640 --> 08:28.680
That's not the case.

08:29.240 --> 08:30.440
I'm telling the truth.

08:31.080 --> 08:32.720
- You're not--
- First,

08:32.799 --> 08:34.880
you can't say how I killed Jiang Li.

08:35.520 --> 08:36.360
Second,

08:36.840 --> 08:39.480
you can't tell
where the real Jiang Li is now.

08:39.559 --> 08:41.360
On what grounds
can you slader my identity?

08:42.120 --> 08:42.960
Moreover,

08:43.039 --> 08:45.000
Zhennv Hall's management is very strict.

08:45.480 --> 08:48.120
How can a living person
be replaced just like that?

08:48.200 --> 08:49.040
Besides,

08:50.080 --> 08:51.320
my maid, Tong'er,

08:51.960 --> 08:53.640
grew up with me.

08:53.720 --> 08:55.880
Are you saying she was replaced too?

08:55.960 --> 08:57.440
That's because you're in cahoots!

08:57.520 --> 08:59.160
My father knows that Tong'er

08:59.240 --> 09:00.360
is loyal to me.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.040
She gave up on serving the Jiang family

09:03.120 --> 09:05.240
and followed me to Zhennv Hall to suffer.

09:05.320 --> 09:07.080
If I'm an impostor,

09:07.160 --> 09:08.600
how could she spare me?

09:09.160 --> 09:10.400
Shou Zhen, let me remind you.

09:11.120 --> 09:13.600
No matter who ordered you to slander me,

09:13.680 --> 09:14.920
you must remember

09:15.000 --> 09:17.120
that whether you succeed or not,

09:17.880 --> 09:19.720
you won't end up well.

09:19.800 --> 09:21.800
You spoke up
in front of His Majesty today.

09:22.360 --> 09:23.560
If you succeed,

09:24.040 --> 09:25.200
you're a hold over someone.

09:25.680 --> 09:26.520
If you don't,

09:27.080 --> 09:28.360
you're still a hold over someone.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.880
You'll be gotten rid of.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.760
So the only way to be safe is

09:31.840 --> 09:32.840
to get your head straight

09:33.320 --> 09:35.000
and distinguish right from wrong.

09:36.680 --> 09:38.960
Ms. Xue, you're so eloquent.

09:39.880 --> 09:41.560
You can make a lie sound like the truth.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.640
It seems like Your Highness

09:44.680 --> 09:46.760
isn't willing to believe
the truth I spoke today.

09:46.840 --> 09:49.640
Actually,
aside from the Chief of Zhennv Hall,

09:50.120 --> 09:51.840
there are other people who can prove

09:51.920 --> 09:53.560
that I am the real Jiang Li.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.520
Who?

09:54.600 --> 09:56.920
Why don't we summon her to find out?

09:59.000 --> 10:00.600
My men have sent word

10:01.080 --> 10:04.000
that the Chief of Zhennv Hall,
who was imprisoned in Hui City,

10:04.080 --> 10:05.200
has been brought out.

10:06.720 --> 10:08.800
It seems like someone
is up to no good today.

10:08.880 --> 10:10.400
Thank you for notifying me, Duke Su.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.840
Have you thought of a solution?

10:11.920 --> 10:13.120
I don't have anyone to use.

10:15.200 --> 10:18.040
- Can you help me find someone?
- Who is it?

10:18.120 --> 10:19.480
A girl from Zhennv Hall.

10:19.560 --> 10:21.960
Tell me her name.
I'll ask Lu Ji to look for her.

10:22.520 --> 10:24.000
And pass on a message to her for me.

10:29.120 --> 10:31.040
Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:33.040 --> 10:34.320
So it's you.

10:34.880 --> 10:35.720
Tell them

10:36.760 --> 10:38.520
that she's not Jiang Li.

10:39.560 --> 10:41.200
You have no choice but to go this time.

10:41.280 --> 10:42.920
She asked me to pass on a message to you.

10:45.280 --> 10:46.160
What is it?

10:46.240 --> 10:47.200
She said

10:47.760 --> 10:50.600
bribery is the worst tactic of all,

10:51.440 --> 10:53.040
so she won't promise you anything.

10:54.080 --> 10:54.920
However,

10:55.000 --> 10:57.120
it's your only chance to redeem yourself

10:57.200 --> 11:00.200
for what you did in the past.

11:00.280 --> 11:01.160
I'm sorry.

11:03.000 --> 11:05.480
I apologize for everything I did.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.520
I'm sorry, Ms. Jiang Li.

11:07.600 --> 11:09.000
What nonsense are you talking about?

11:09.640 --> 11:10.960
What nonsense are you saying?

11:11.440 --> 11:13.240
She is not Jiang Li!

11:14.120 --> 11:15.160
She is Jiang Li.

11:15.640 --> 11:16.880
She is Jiang Li!

11:16.960 --> 11:18.080
- Nonsense!
- She is.

11:18.160 --> 11:20.600
She is not Jiang Li.
She is not Jiang Li at all!

11:20.680 --> 11:21.840
She is Jiang Li.

11:21.920 --> 11:23.520
- She is Jiang Li!
- What's wrong with you?

11:23.600 --> 11:26.480
- Ms. Jiang Li, I'm sorry.
- She's not.

11:26.560 --> 11:28.280
I apologize for what I did.

11:28.360 --> 11:29.800
- Don't talk nonsense!
- Ms. Jiang Li.

11:29.880 --> 11:32.480
- Ms. Jiang Li, please forgive me.
- Bring both of them out.

11:32.560 --> 11:34.320
- She is Jiang Li!
- She is not Jiang Li!

11:34.400 --> 11:36.320
- She's Jiang Li!
- Ms. Jiang Li, please forgive me!

11:36.400 --> 11:38.280
You can't lie to His Majesty!

11:38.360 --> 11:39.680
You can't!

11:39.760 --> 11:41.520
She is not Jiang Li!

11:42.440 --> 11:43.840
You've got a real knack

11:45.400 --> 11:47.600
for getting these people
to tell lies for you.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.680
Very good. Mr. Shen.

11:50.280 --> 11:53.520
You and your wife have helped each other
in humble circumstances for so many years.

11:54.080 --> 11:56.160
You wouldn't tell lies, would you?

11:56.240 --> 12:00.480
Is this Mrs. Shen, whom you miss

12:00.560 --> 12:02.920
and lived together with?

12:05.400 --> 12:06.360
Wanning,

12:06.440 --> 12:07.560
stop messing around.

12:08.120 --> 12:08.960
Is she

12:09.440 --> 12:10.680
your wife?

12:58.080 --> 12:58.920
No.

13:01.720 --> 13:03.160
Shen Yurong, what did you say?

13:03.760 --> 13:05.440
How could she not be Xue Fangfei?

13:05.520 --> 13:07.160
You're lying. She's obviously Xue Fangfei!

13:07.240 --> 13:08.160
Your Highness,

13:09.360 --> 13:10.880
my wife is dead.

13:11.920 --> 13:14.520
Even if someone looks exactly like her,

13:15.160 --> 13:16.400
it's not her.

13:16.480 --> 13:18.080
Shen Yurong, are you blind?

13:18.160 --> 13:19.760
Can't you even recognize your own wife?

13:19.840 --> 13:21.560
Your Highness, please mind your words.

13:23.000 --> 13:24.800
Don't be discourteous
in front of His Majesty.

13:25.640 --> 13:27.760
It's impossible for me
not to recognize my own wife.

13:34.040 --> 13:36.120
Then let's open the coffin
and examine the body.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.160
My late wife died in the mountains

13:44.920 --> 13:46.440
and I couldn't find her body,

13:47.040 --> 13:49.240
so I had to build an empty tomb for her.

13:49.800 --> 13:51.160
Your Highness,

13:52.560 --> 13:53.480
what can you examine?

13:53.560 --> 13:55.520
Who says I want
to examine Xue Fangfei's body?

13:55.600 --> 13:57.400
Xue Fangfei is standing right here

13:57.480 --> 14:00.400
and she killed and buried the real
Jiang Li long ago in Qingcheng Mountain.

14:02.760 --> 14:06.480
- Really?
- Right.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.680
Dear, have you forgotten?

14:11.760 --> 14:13.200
Li'er grew up at Zhennv Hall

14:13.280 --> 14:14.800
and hasn't been to school much.

14:14.880 --> 14:16.760
Neat but forceful.

14:16.840 --> 14:19.720
Straight but sharp.

14:19.800 --> 14:22.440
Since ancient times, trying to overturn
a convicted official's verdict

14:22.520 --> 14:25.160
is like accusing the authorities
and challenging those in power.

14:25.240 --> 14:27.120
She has no idea
how serious the situation is!

14:28.040 --> 14:29.960
There are so many miserable people
in the world.

14:30.040 --> 14:32.720
Why did Ms. Jiang Li do everything

14:32.800 --> 14:35.440
to save Xue Huaiyuan at all costs?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.520
Chancellor Jiang,

14:38.360 --> 14:40.800
your real daughter, Jiang Li,

14:41.280 --> 14:42.880
is buried in Qingcheng Mountain.

14:43.360 --> 14:45.440
I've found her tomb.

14:46.000 --> 14:49.280
If you open the coffin
and let the coroner examine the body,

14:49.960 --> 14:52.680
you'll know who your real daughter is.

14:58.200 --> 14:59.040
Father,

14:59.600 --> 15:01.520
it seems like Her Highness

15:01.600 --> 15:03.200
won't let me go today.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.800
Guards,

15:05.360 --> 15:06.880
go to Qingcheng Mountain

15:06.960 --> 15:08.440
and bring back the body immediately.

15:10.400 --> 15:13.000
Since Her Highness said these things,

15:14.000 --> 15:16.080
I need to give my father an explanation.

15:16.640 --> 15:17.880
Just because you're my father,

15:17.960 --> 15:19.160
things have become difficult

15:20.520 --> 15:21.760
for you

15:22.400 --> 15:23.880
and the Jiang family can't have peace.

15:24.520 --> 15:26.440
I'm really sorry.

15:26.520 --> 15:28.920
Don't make it sound so grandiose.

15:29.480 --> 15:32.160
I'm trying to rectify
the Jiang family's bloodline.

15:32.240 --> 15:33.480
Your Highness, thank you then

15:33.960 --> 15:35.240
for thinking

15:35.760 --> 15:37.720
of the Jiang family at this moment.

15:37.800 --> 15:38.640
If that's the case,

15:39.440 --> 15:40.600
summon the coroner.

15:41.920 --> 15:43.000
There's no need.

15:43.760 --> 15:46.640
Your Highness, I've never had
much interaction with you.

15:46.720 --> 15:51.400
I'm flattered that you show such concern

15:51.480 --> 15:53.400
for my family.

15:54.160 --> 15:58.360
But I'm not yet too old to see clearly.

15:58.440 --> 16:02.040
Of course I can recognize my own daughter.

16:04.000 --> 16:06.560
Don't you want to know

16:06.640 --> 16:09.000
who your real daughter is?

16:09.080 --> 16:10.960
It's the crime of deceiving His Majesty.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.720
Your Highness,

16:12.800 --> 16:16.160
I know my daughter
offended a lot of people

16:16.240 --> 16:18.040
trying to overturn a good official's case.

16:18.120 --> 16:22.080
But my daughter did her best

16:22.160 --> 16:23.720
to overcome all the difficulties,

16:23.800 --> 16:27.360
so I can't be left behind.

16:27.440 --> 16:30.680
If I can't even recognize my own family,

16:30.760 --> 16:33.400
I'll be ashamed

16:34.040 --> 16:37.760
to face the ancestors
of the Jiang family in the afterlife.

16:39.760 --> 16:43.080
His Majesty's time should not be spent
on the family affairs of the Jiang family.

16:43.640 --> 16:46.520
Now that the Xue Huaiyuan
corruption case is closed,

16:47.080 --> 16:49.960
I'll take my daughter home.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.160
Chancellor Jiang,

16:56.800 --> 16:57.640
I must examine

16:58.240 --> 16:59.440
the body today.

16:59.520 --> 17:00.680
Enough!

17:00.760 --> 17:01.600
Your Majesty,

17:02.160 --> 17:03.600
you're the emperor.

17:03.680 --> 17:05.960
How can you allow
these people to deceive you?

17:06.040 --> 17:07.359
How can you uphold your authority?

17:07.440 --> 17:09.839
Wanning, I've already
put up with you a lot.

17:10.599 --> 17:11.800
If you keep this up,

17:12.560 --> 17:14.280
you'll be acting treacherously.

17:17.520 --> 17:19.680
I was in a good mood
since we vindicated a good official,

17:19.760 --> 17:20.640
but now you ruined it.

17:20.720 --> 17:22.119
You disregarded palace rules today

17:22.200 --> 17:23.960
and behaved recklessly
in the imperial court today.

17:24.040 --> 17:24.880
You're ridiculous!

17:25.440 --> 17:26.280
Guards!

17:26.359 --> 17:28.079
Take the Eldest Princess back
to her mansion!

17:29.960 --> 17:30.800
Let go.

17:31.360 --> 17:32.200
Let go of me.

17:32.280 --> 17:33.480
Let go.

17:33.560 --> 17:34.520
Let go!

17:36.400 --> 17:38.040
I'm the Eldest Princess of Great Yan.

17:38.120 --> 17:39.160
How dare you touch me!

17:39.240 --> 17:40.160
Take her away!

17:41.080 --> 17:41.960
Zhao Ye,

17:42.040 --> 17:43.000
how dare you confine me?

17:43.080 --> 17:45.040
The imperial court session is done today.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.520
If Eldest Princess doesn't comply,

17:48.080 --> 17:49.360
you'll be disobeying my decree.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.240
- Your Highness.
- Xue Fangfei!

17:56.320 --> 17:57.560
Don't do that.

18:22.120 --> 18:22.960
Xiao Heng,

18:23.040 --> 18:24.120
how dare you!

18:25.040 --> 18:26.440
From today onward,

18:27.000 --> 18:28.200
without my order,

18:28.280 --> 18:30.760
the Eldest Princess is not allowed
to leave her mansion!

18:33.960 --> 18:35.920
The imperial court session
has ended today.

18:36.000 --> 18:38.160
- Let go. Xue Fangfei, just wait!
- Dismiss!

19:18.720 --> 19:19.560
Father,

19:20.560 --> 19:21.840
I have a favor to ask.

19:22.480 --> 19:23.480
Go ahead.

19:23.560 --> 19:26.080
The former subordinates of Magistrate Xue

19:26.160 --> 19:27.960
and the people of Huaixiang
who came to the capital with me

19:28.040 --> 19:29.240
are in Ye Shijie's residence.

19:29.800 --> 19:31.400
Since I brought them here,

19:31.480 --> 19:32.720
I should finish what I started.

19:32.800 --> 19:34.880
I must entertain them well
before sending them back.

19:35.680 --> 19:37.440
I have to go to Ye Residence now.

19:37.520 --> 19:39.360
After such a mess,

19:40.040 --> 19:42.040
you'll have to clean it up.

19:43.040 --> 19:44.760
Just come back when you're done.

19:45.440 --> 19:46.400
Then

19:47.480 --> 19:49.800
it's time we have a talk.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.080
Yes,

19:52.560 --> 19:53.560
Father.

19:56.520 --> 19:57.520
Remember.

20:01.080 --> 20:03.400
You're the daughter of the Jiang family.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.120
Little civet?

20:15.640 --> 20:17.040
You're quite interesting.

20:18.120 --> 20:20.000
Everyone in the capital is praising you

20:20.600 --> 20:21.920
for clearing unjust cases

20:22.000 --> 20:23.520
and redressing people's grievances.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.040
What are you doing here

20:26.560 --> 20:28.200
instead of receiving praise out there?

20:29.400 --> 20:30.760
What's the matter?

20:30.840 --> 20:32.200
I want to ask you a favor.

20:32.280 --> 20:33.440
What is it?

20:35.600 --> 20:37.360
There's a grave in Qingcheng Mountain

20:40.000 --> 20:41.320
and I'd like you

20:43.280 --> 20:45.360
to dig up the body

20:46.280 --> 20:47.280
and rebury it for me.

20:54.800 --> 20:56.320
Who's buried in there?

20:58.880 --> 21:00.320
Why don't you go yourself?

21:01.480 --> 21:02.480
Duke Su,

21:04.120 --> 21:05.640
are you interrogating me?

21:06.200 --> 21:07.560
You could say that.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.200
Fine.

21:09.280 --> 21:11.120
- Forget I said anything.
- Wait.

21:14.800 --> 21:16.120
I can dig up the grave for you,

21:16.600 --> 21:18.960
but it's a long way to Qingcheng Mountain.

21:19.040 --> 21:19.960
It's boring.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.120
I don't want to go alone.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.800
What do you mean?

21:27.120 --> 21:28.000
Come with me.

21:48.080 --> 21:49.640
Why did you insist on bringing me here?

21:51.480 --> 21:54.800
I guessed you'd want
to come here to bid farewell.

21:55.760 --> 21:57.640
I just want to forget about this place.

21:58.800 --> 22:00.200
If you want to forget this place,

22:01.280 --> 22:02.760
then why do you want to move it away?

22:06.680 --> 22:08.200
You know why.

22:08.280 --> 22:11.880
Isn't Xue Fangfei the one buried here?

22:16.760 --> 22:17.960
Xue Fangfei

22:19.200 --> 22:21.680
is an unclean woman in everyone's eyes.

22:24.000 --> 22:25.600
She already lived a miserable life.

22:28.240 --> 22:30.760
Now that the Eldest Princess
is thinking of digging up the grave,

22:31.760 --> 22:33.480
I must move her body.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.880
I don't want anyone to disturb her.

22:37.000 --> 22:37.840
What about you?

22:39.880 --> 22:41.280
I don't want to disturb her either.

22:44.960 --> 22:47.200
She was clean.

22:50.360 --> 22:52.120
She was a good person.

22:53.800 --> 22:56.360
She thought she loved a good man.

22:59.000 --> 23:01.800
She just wanted
to live a good life with him.

23:02.680 --> 23:03.720
And for that,

23:04.400 --> 23:06.520
she gave all she had got,

23:09.120 --> 23:10.520
including herself

23:12.040 --> 23:13.080
and her family.

23:14.760 --> 23:16.040
But in the end,

23:17.280 --> 23:20.600
she's lying alone in this cold place.

23:22.200 --> 23:23.400
What else?

23:23.960 --> 23:26.560
She was a woman of noble status.

23:28.200 --> 23:30.200
She was a good woman.

23:30.760 --> 23:32.680
She didn't commit matricide or fratricide.

23:32.760 --> 23:34.200
She just wanted to go home.

23:35.360 --> 23:36.200
And for that,

23:37.040 --> 23:39.920
she waited ten years
at Qingcheng Mountain.

23:40.000 --> 23:41.120
Ten years.

23:42.800 --> 23:44.320
But in the end,

23:45.440 --> 23:47.120
she's lying in this place too.

23:49.760 --> 23:51.520
I failed to protect her.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.720
You've already done a great job.

23:57.720 --> 23:58.920
She won't blame you.

23:59.000 --> 24:00.280
You vindicated the Xue family,

24:01.440 --> 24:03.880
won Jiang Yuanbai's approval
for his daughter,

24:04.560 --> 24:06.560
and redressed injustice
for the people of Huaixiang.

24:09.200 --> 24:10.280
As a pawn,

24:11.080 --> 24:12.480
I'm very satisfied with you.

24:17.520 --> 24:19.280
Is there anything else
you want to tell her?

24:23.200 --> 24:24.200
I've said it all.

24:26.800 --> 24:28.040
Then I'll have someone

24:28.680 --> 24:29.560
replace her body.

24:36.080 --> 24:37.040
Duke Su,

24:37.880 --> 24:38.720
thank you

24:39.240 --> 24:40.720
for helping me protect Li.

24:42.560 --> 24:43.440
So Li,

24:44.800 --> 24:45.800
starting today,

24:47.320 --> 24:49.320
you don't have to fear anyone anymore.

25:13.280 --> 25:14.200
Take it.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.560
Thank you.

25:18.400 --> 25:19.240
Sir.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.720
- I'll have two.
- All right.

25:53.680 --> 25:54.680
This one.

25:54.760 --> 25:56.440
Do you like this or this?

25:57.040 --> 25:58.360
I think this is better.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.120
This one?

26:08.600 --> 26:09.520
Ms. Jiang Li.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.480
Mr. Shen.

26:28.040 --> 26:30.120
Ms. Jiang Li,

26:31.280 --> 26:32.280
you look well today.

26:32.840 --> 26:34.560
It's because I've figured something out.

26:35.320 --> 26:36.600
I'm willing to listen to it.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.600
Your late wife

26:40.680 --> 26:43.800
once saved my life
when I was on the verge of death.

26:44.360 --> 26:45.520
I used to wonder

26:47.040 --> 26:48.640
why a person who couldn't protect herself

26:49.440 --> 26:51.600
would drag me back from hell.

26:52.720 --> 26:54.600
I used to think it was because of hatred.

26:55.120 --> 26:56.480
Hatred for the unfair world.

26:58.720 --> 27:00.000
Hatred for her heartless husband.

27:00.520 --> 27:01.600
She was resentful.

27:03.120 --> 27:04.360
Now, I understand.

27:04.920 --> 27:05.880
The world is vast,

27:06.760 --> 27:07.760
the nation is prosperous,

27:08.320 --> 27:09.440
and the people are numerous.

27:11.280 --> 27:12.280
She saved me

27:12.920 --> 27:14.800
because she was a wonderful person.

27:16.800 --> 27:18.560
She hadn't seen enough of this world.

27:20.040 --> 27:22.560
So how could a mean, pathetic man

27:23.200 --> 27:24.800
impede her?

27:31.600 --> 27:33.000
Is that really what she thought?

27:34.320 --> 27:35.320
You will find out.

28:18.000 --> 28:21.560
DELICIOUS BEVERAGES

28:56.960 --> 28:58.720
It was a miscalculation on my part.

29:00.320 --> 29:03.000
I'm willing to accept punishment.

29:03.080 --> 29:05.480
Don't blame yourself, Chancellor Li.

29:06.800 --> 29:08.880
You've already done a great job.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.880
It was because of my faulty planning

29:10.960 --> 29:12.880
that you've suffered.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.120
Your Highness.

29:14.880 --> 29:16.800
I'm going to have to rely on you

29:17.360 --> 29:19.280
while I'm grounded.

29:20.200 --> 29:21.600
I, Li Zhongnan,

29:22.240 --> 29:25.840
will be at Your Highness
and Prince Cheng's beck and call.

29:29.840 --> 29:30.960
Chancellor Li,

29:31.040 --> 29:32.040
please get up.

29:33.520 --> 29:35.040
Thank you, Your Highness.

29:40.360 --> 29:41.600
I have a secret letter here.

29:42.600 --> 29:44.200
Please give it to the Imperial Diviner.

29:47.320 --> 29:48.720
Also, tell Mr. Shen to come in.

29:57.760 --> 29:58.680
Mr. Shen,

29:59.520 --> 30:00.760
you've been kneeling all night.

30:01.280 --> 30:02.520
Now, it's your turn.

30:16.720 --> 30:17.680
Shen Yurong,

30:17.760 --> 30:19.400
do you take me for a fool?

30:20.560 --> 30:22.000
Your Highness is a noble.

30:23.000 --> 30:25.280
If Xue Fangfei's identity
is exposed in the imperial court,

30:25.760 --> 30:26.840
I don't care if I die.

30:26.920 --> 30:29.840
But if my mother and sister
drag Your Highness into this

30:29.920 --> 30:31.520
and damage your reputation,

30:32.080 --> 30:32.960
it'll be my fault.

30:33.560 --> 30:34.520
So

30:35.800 --> 30:36.960
she can only be Jiang Li.

30:37.040 --> 30:38.320
I don't care who she is.

30:39.240 --> 30:40.560
She must die now.

30:41.320 --> 30:42.600
It's easy to kill her.

30:43.640 --> 30:45.520
Your Highness doesn't have
to get your hands dirty.

30:45.600 --> 30:46.880
Just like today's incident,

30:48.040 --> 30:49.880
I warned Your Highness not to intervene,

30:50.760 --> 30:51.800
but you didn't believe me

30:52.320 --> 30:53.520
and acted rashly

30:54.480 --> 30:56.080
to your own detriment.

30:56.160 --> 30:58.600
Then what should I do?

30:58.680 --> 31:00.040
Jiang Li has many enemies.

31:01.880 --> 31:02.880
Your Highness can

31:04.760 --> 31:05.720
use others to kill her.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.480
Can you bring yourself to kill her?

31:10.520 --> 31:11.520
For you,

31:13.600 --> 31:14.720
I can kill anyone.

31:18.280 --> 31:20.720
The way you talk is heartbreaking.

31:21.280 --> 31:24.040
It's a pity I can't adore you
during this time.

31:52.880 --> 31:53.920
My lord,

31:54.000 --> 31:55.600
His Majesty wants
to get to the bottom of it.

31:55.680 --> 31:57.280
How can we let Li Zhongnan go?

31:57.760 --> 31:59.280
Leave a way out for a surrounded enemy.

31:59.360 --> 32:00.720
Don't press a desperate foe too hard.

32:00.800 --> 32:01.920
What does it mean?

32:07.200 --> 32:08.080
Lu Ji,

32:08.920 --> 32:09.760
explain it.

32:10.360 --> 32:12.040
Even Wanning,
who's never been punished before,

32:12.120 --> 32:13.560
was punished by His Majesty.

32:13.640 --> 32:15.200
If we pick on Li Zhongnan at this time,

32:15.280 --> 32:16.600
it may cause trouble.

32:17.880 --> 32:19.480
When the sword is sheathed,

32:19.560 --> 32:21.480
it will kill.

32:37.040 --> 32:40.000
After eliminating Li Zhongnan's men
like Wei Qian and Zhang Kun,

32:40.640 --> 32:43.080
Li Zhongnan won't be able
to make a move again for a while.

32:44.320 --> 32:46.360
That's the end of the Huaixiang case.

32:46.440 --> 32:47.480
I'm guessing

32:48.320 --> 32:50.280
Wanning still has tricks up her sleeve.

32:50.920 --> 32:52.160
What should we do next?

32:52.760 --> 32:53.760
Wen Ji,

32:53.840 --> 32:55.040
tell me.

32:55.120 --> 32:56.240
Well… I…

32:57.240 --> 32:58.120
Don't stammer.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.320
Think before speaking.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.520
Or you might get caned again.

33:01.400 --> 33:03.240
My lord, give me a moment to think.

33:03.800 --> 33:05.120
You even have to think about this?

33:05.200 --> 33:06.520
Cane him.

33:10.080 --> 33:11.280
Just wait and see.

33:11.760 --> 33:12.760
Idiot.

33:15.320 --> 33:16.400
That's not right.

33:16.480 --> 33:17.800
His lordship is asking what to do.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.920
Waiting and seeing means doing nothing.

33:20.000 --> 33:21.040
This isn't fair, my lord.

33:21.120 --> 33:22.280
The question makes no sense.

33:23.400 --> 33:27.480
Stop the boat and ask

33:27.960 --> 33:34.800
For help

33:36.080 --> 33:41.240
Perhaps we have

33:41.320 --> 33:47.160
The same hometown

33:48.640 --> 33:55.640
My home is near Jiujiang

34:00.880 --> 34:01.760
Your Highness, please spare me.

34:01.840 --> 34:03.520
What the heck were you singing?

34:04.840 --> 34:06.440
Isn't there anyone who can sing?

34:08.800 --> 34:10.080
Your Highness, please spare me.

34:10.159 --> 34:11.400
Your Highness, please spare me.

34:11.480 --> 34:13.639
We can't find someone
like Little Taohong in the north.

34:14.199 --> 34:16.440
Unless we can search
in the Central Plains.

34:18.280 --> 34:19.239
Guys,

34:20.520 --> 34:22.840
you've been fighting alongside me
for so many years.

34:23.400 --> 34:25.679
If you can't even watch a good opera,

34:25.760 --> 34:27.239
you can tolerate it, but I can't.

34:28.280 --> 34:30.600
The time for achieving glory is coming.

34:31.639 --> 34:33.800
When we take over the Central Plains,

34:33.880 --> 34:37.000
we'll enjoy whatever opera we want

34:37.080 --> 34:40.520
and get any woman we want.

34:40.600 --> 34:45.800
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

34:45.880 --> 34:51.000
- Prince Cheng!
- Prince Cheng!

35:06.000 --> 35:06.840
Your Highness,

35:07.400 --> 35:09.320
the Eldest Princess has been grounded.

35:09.920 --> 35:11.200
That crazy sister of mine.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.360
I thought she had some ability,

35:14.120 --> 35:16.200
but she's such a disappointment.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.920
The cold season is here in the north.

35:18.840 --> 35:20.080
The gold mines are closed now.

35:20.840 --> 35:22.000
The Ministry of War is giving

35:22.080 --> 35:23.360
lesser wages and rations every year.

35:23.440 --> 35:24.320
At this rate,

35:25.320 --> 35:26.400
we'll have a hard time.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.920
As long as we have battle merits,

35:28.400 --> 35:30.400
my brother in the palace
has to give us rations.

35:31.040 --> 35:32.000
But Dai

35:32.880 --> 35:33.920
hasn't made a move lately.

35:34.000 --> 35:36.240
If there's nothing, make something up.

35:37.480 --> 35:39.480
As long as we make it look like
Dai is invading,

35:40.320 --> 35:43.560
we'll fight the invaders
with all our strength

35:44.880 --> 35:46.320
in the north.

35:47.720 --> 35:50.320
I'll go to the border to create a riot.

35:51.240 --> 35:52.880
I wish Your Highness a successful victory

35:52.960 --> 35:54.560
over the invaders in advance.

35:58.640 --> 36:01.760
Yurong, why lock yourself up?

36:01.840 --> 36:03.600
What did the Eldest Princess tell you?

36:03.680 --> 36:04.880
Tell us.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.120
Yes, Yurong.

36:06.200 --> 36:07.320
You're scaring us.

36:07.400 --> 36:09.960
You were not blamed
for what Her Highness has done, right?

36:10.040 --> 36:13.680
You shouldn't have disobeyed
Her Highness in the hall.

36:13.760 --> 36:15.800
Forget it if you're not concerned
about Her Highness,

36:15.880 --> 36:18.240
but you must be concerned about us.

36:18.760 --> 36:21.520
I'm just an old widow, so it's fine.

36:21.600 --> 36:24.320
But I pity your sister.
She's still unmarried.

36:24.920 --> 36:26.720
I'm counting on Her Highness

36:26.800 --> 36:30.400
- to find a good match for your sister.
- Get lost!

36:34.280 --> 36:35.520
Forget it, Mother.

36:36.600 --> 36:38.280
Yurong must be tired today.

36:39.000 --> 36:40.680
Let's not bother him.

36:40.760 --> 36:42.040
He knows what to do.

37:13.880 --> 37:15.400
I used to wonder

37:15.480 --> 37:17.200
why a person who couldn't protect herself

37:17.280 --> 37:19.480
would drag me back from hell.

37:19.560 --> 37:21.920
I used to think it was because of hatred.

37:22.480 --> 37:23.960
Hatred for the unfair world.

37:24.040 --> 37:25.560
Hatred for her heartless husband.

37:26.120 --> 37:28.800
So how could a mean, pathetic man

37:28.880 --> 37:30.720
impede her?

37:42.960 --> 37:45.880
Now, the Jiang family
is no longer in turmoil.

37:46.400 --> 37:48.840
You can finally rest assured, can't you?

37:49.880 --> 37:52.480
Who do you think Li'er takes after?

37:53.040 --> 37:54.680
His lordship, of course.

37:56.880 --> 37:58.320
As a woman,

37:59.240 --> 38:02.720
she has the courage to fight for justice.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.760
In my opinion,

38:04.760 --> 38:05.840
she's like Old Master.

38:05.920 --> 38:08.960
The blood of the Jiang family
runs in Ms. Jiang Li's veins,

38:09.040 --> 38:12.480
so of course she has inherited
the ancestor's character.

38:12.560 --> 38:15.160
We've misjudged her for so many years.

38:16.280 --> 38:17.480
We owe her so much.

38:17.560 --> 38:20.800
Ms. Jiang Li is very sensible.
She won't mind.

38:20.880 --> 38:22.440
You can't say that.

38:22.520 --> 38:23.840
She's bighearted,

38:23.920 --> 38:25.680
but she's still young.

38:25.760 --> 38:27.400
She was away all these years.

38:27.480 --> 38:29.200
How could she not miss
the warmth of family?

38:29.280 --> 38:33.040
When she comes back,
I must reward her well.

38:33.840 --> 38:34.880
Tell the servants

38:35.600 --> 38:38.400
to prepare a feast for Li'er's return.

38:38.480 --> 38:39.320
Yes.

38:41.360 --> 38:42.320
Madam Ji,

38:42.400 --> 38:44.880
I heard that Old Madam
had no intention of blaming Jiang Li.

38:45.400 --> 38:47.280
She even wants to prepare a feast
for her return.

38:47.360 --> 38:49.400
Jiang Li is in the limelight now

38:49.920 --> 38:51.840
and she's bringing honor
to the Jiang family.

38:52.360 --> 38:54.080
Old Madam would naturally support her.

38:54.160 --> 38:56.160
Finally, Jiang Li got into trouble

38:56.240 --> 38:58.080
and was imprisoned
in the Court of Judicial Review.

38:58.160 --> 39:00.080
Why did you help get her out?

39:02.120 --> 39:04.440
When one falls in disgrace,
the whole family is doomed.

39:04.920 --> 39:05.840
She's smart.

39:06.880 --> 39:08.680
She knows that her honor and disgrace

39:08.760 --> 39:11.200
are tied to the Jiang family
at the moment.

39:13.040 --> 39:15.920
Even I had no choice but to save her.

39:16.000 --> 39:18.480
Then we won't be able
to do anything to her anymore.

39:18.560 --> 39:20.040
Jin Dai, sit down.

39:23.920 --> 39:25.840
I one-sidedly helped her

39:25.920 --> 39:27.240
and now my husband and Old Madam

39:27.320 --> 39:29.760
are one-sidedly hosting a feast
for her return too, aren't they?

39:29.840 --> 39:32.960
But does Jiang Li appreciate
the Jiang family's kindness at all?

39:33.040 --> 39:36.160
Let them flatter her all they want.

39:36.240 --> 39:39.320
They won't know the pain
until they're trampled on.

39:39.880 --> 39:40.960
As for us,

39:41.040 --> 39:43.120
we just need to remind Old Madam

39:43.200 --> 39:44.640
at the right time

39:44.720 --> 39:48.240
to let her know who Jiang Li
regards as her family.

39:48.320 --> 39:49.160
That will be enough.

39:49.240 --> 39:50.720
You're really wise.

39:50.800 --> 39:52.280
I heard that

39:53.280 --> 39:56.280
Magistrate Xue and the people of Huaixiang

39:56.360 --> 39:57.640
are staying with the Ye family.

39:57.720 --> 39:59.240
Yes.

39:59.760 --> 40:02.840
The Ye family is indeed rich.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.760
They're even planning
a celebration banquet

40:04.840 --> 40:07.840
for Jiang Li and the people of Huaixiang.

40:07.920 --> 40:08.760
Very good.

40:09.320 --> 40:10.840
Try to find out the date.

40:11.440 --> 40:13.600
The feast arranged by Old Madam
for her return

40:14.520 --> 40:17.080
must be held on the same day
as their celebration banquet.

40:17.680 --> 40:21.040
Let's see if Jiang Li is willing
to leave the people of Huaixiang behind

40:21.120 --> 40:24.480
or stand my husband and Old Madam up
here in the Jiang Residence.

40:24.560 --> 40:25.640
I got it.

40:28.640 --> 40:30.800
YE RESIDENCE

40:45.560 --> 40:46.560
Thank you, physician.

40:47.240 --> 40:48.880
How is Magistrate Xue's condition?

40:49.360 --> 40:51.920
Magistrate Xue's physical wounds

40:52.000 --> 40:53.760
will heal in time,

40:53.840 --> 40:57.120
but his delusional disorder
may be hard to recover from.

40:57.200 --> 40:58.880
What is delusional disorder?

40:58.960 --> 41:01.040
This disorder makes someone feel restless.

41:01.120 --> 41:03.280
He would often feel that his soul
has left his body,

41:03.360 --> 41:04.480
have nightmares,

41:04.560 --> 41:06.840
forget his family,

41:06.920 --> 41:08.480
forget past events,

41:08.560 --> 41:10.600
and forget himself.

41:10.680 --> 41:14.160
In my opinion, it's because
Magistrate Xue lost his children,

41:14.240 --> 41:15.760
got involved in an unjust case,

41:15.840 --> 41:17.640
and was heavily tortured,

41:17.720 --> 41:19.600
which made his soul leave his body
from the pain

41:19.680 --> 41:22.080
and develop into an illness
that built up over time.

41:22.160 --> 41:23.760
How can it be cured?

41:23.840 --> 41:27.280
Depression is like a thousand feet of ice,

41:27.360 --> 41:28.760
which can't be melted in a day.

42:03.240 --> 42:04.720
They say true experts are among the folks.

42:05.600 --> 42:07.440
Just because imperial physicians
can't cure him

42:07.520 --> 42:08.960
doesn't mean folk physicians can't.

42:09.040 --> 42:10.960
No matter how much money I have to spend,

42:11.040 --> 42:12.920
I'll cure Magistrate Xue.

42:13.000 --> 42:15.840
This is a favor I owe the Xue family.

42:16.920 --> 42:18.080
You shouldn't repay it for me.

42:18.640 --> 42:21.160
You've helped me so much along the way.

42:21.240 --> 42:23.720
Jiang Li, remember this.

42:24.760 --> 42:26.720
The Ye family
will be your backing from now on.

42:26.800 --> 42:27.680
I…

42:29.200 --> 42:30.320
am the same.

42:30.960 --> 42:31.880
I will remember it.

42:40.560 --> 42:41.880
How is she now?

42:43.160 --> 42:44.160
Last time,

42:44.240 --> 42:46.680
you told me not to waste manpower
on useless things,

42:46.760 --> 42:49.360
so I don't know what Ms. Jiang Li

42:49.440 --> 42:50.320
is doing now.

42:54.360 --> 42:55.360
Thirty canes.

42:55.880 --> 42:58.280
She's having a celebration banquet
at the Ye Residence

42:58.360 --> 42:59.560
to thank

42:59.640 --> 43:01.760
the people of Huaixiang who came with her.

43:01.840 --> 43:02.680
To thank them?

43:04.720 --> 43:05.680
At Ye Residence?

43:05.760 --> 43:06.600
Yes.

43:07.080 --> 43:09.440
Ye Residence, where the handsome,

43:09.520 --> 43:13.240
young, and talented Ye Shijie is.

43:13.320 --> 43:15.160
Go get her for me.

43:15.240 --> 43:16.440
I don't think it's a good idea.

43:16.520 --> 43:17.560
I'm afraid Ms. Jiang Li

43:17.640 --> 43:19.280
is already dining at the banquet.

43:20.280 --> 43:21.280
If you can't get her here,

43:21.360 --> 43:23.400
go and get 30 canes.

43:23.480 --> 43:24.320
I…

43:36.640 --> 43:38.440
I'll just use the bowl. Bowls for men.

43:39.240 --> 43:40.360
- Here.
- Cups for women.

43:40.440 --> 43:41.880
- Guys.
- Come on. Try this.

43:41.960 --> 43:43.160
- A toast
- Give it a try.

43:43.240 --> 43:45.240
for Magistrate Xue's redress of injustice.

43:45.720 --> 43:48.640
- Come on, let's drink.
- Here!

43:48.720 --> 43:50.000
One, two, three, bottoms up!

43:50.080 --> 43:51.800
- Come on, bottoms up!
- Bottoms up!

43:51.880 --> 43:54.880
What are your plans when you get back?

43:55.480 --> 43:57.400
I'm going back
to stay in Huaixiang for a while.

43:57.480 --> 43:59.160
If a new magistrate comes,

43:59.760 --> 44:02.760
I'll serve under him
and continue working for Huaixiang.

44:02.840 --> 44:04.160
That's right.

44:04.240 --> 44:05.640
We don't want anything

44:05.720 --> 44:07.720
except to live peacefully in our hometown

44:08.480 --> 44:09.400
and do our old jobs.

44:09.480 --> 44:12.240
Ms. Jiang Li, like Mr. Liu,

44:13.000 --> 44:15.160
I just want to live a good life.

44:16.160 --> 44:19.120
I'm going back too, Jiang Li.

44:19.200 --> 44:20.120
Why are you leaving too?

44:20.200 --> 44:22.760
Your mother's greatest regret in life

44:23.880 --> 44:24.960
was that as a woman,

44:25.920 --> 44:28.680
she couldn't travel the world like a man.

44:28.760 --> 44:30.280
I'm relieved

44:30.360 --> 44:31.520
that you're doing well.

44:31.600 --> 44:33.000
Shijie can take care of you
in the capital,

44:33.080 --> 44:36.600
so I'll explore and travel the world

44:36.680 --> 44:37.880
on behalf of your mother.

44:38.440 --> 44:39.360
But don't worry.

44:39.440 --> 44:42.400
I'm always your third uncle

44:42.480 --> 44:44.440
and Ye Residence is always your home.

44:44.520 --> 44:46.920
And I'm always willing
to be your errand boy.

44:48.280 --> 44:50.040
Ms. Jiang Li, me too.

44:50.120 --> 44:52.240
Ms. Jiang Li, don't forget. I'm here too.

44:52.320 --> 44:53.920
My lady, whatever you want us to do,

44:54.000 --> 44:55.600
we'll be at your service.

44:55.680 --> 44:56.840
Yes, you have us.

44:56.920 --> 44:58.400
Yes, and me too.

45:04.080 --> 45:05.520
I'm deeply grateful

45:06.920 --> 45:08.280
for your friendship.

45:08.840 --> 45:09.880
I'd like to thank you again

45:10.960 --> 45:14.840
for risking your lives
to overturn Magistrate Xue's case.

45:15.400 --> 45:18.520
People unfated will part ways, but those
fated to meet will eventually meet.

45:18.600 --> 45:21.040
I'd like to propose
a farewell toast to you all.

45:21.120 --> 45:23.200
May we meet again in the future.

45:23.280 --> 45:25.880
- Sure. May we meet again.
- All right. See you again.

45:25.960 --> 45:27.080
- See you.
- See you.

45:27.160 --> 45:28.160
- See you.
- See you.

45:32.600 --> 45:33.440
Come on.

45:33.520 --> 45:34.800
Quick, sit down.

45:34.880 --> 45:37.280
Come on, fill my bowl up. Come on.

45:37.360 --> 45:38.520
- Come on.
- Sit down.

45:40.720 --> 45:42.240
- Come on.
- Here's to you.

45:42.720 --> 45:43.680
- Come on.
- Let's drink.

45:43.760 --> 45:45.160
Ms. Jiang Li, have some too.

45:46.280 --> 45:47.560
- Young Master.
- Dig in.

45:47.640 --> 45:49.360
Someone from the Jiang family
is asking to see Ms. Jiang Li.

45:50.360 --> 45:51.280
I'll go out and check.

45:57.320 --> 45:58.840
- Come on. Let's drink.
- Here.

45:58.920 --> 45:59.760
- Come on.
- Quick.

45:59.840 --> 46:00.920
- Here's to you.
- All right.

46:01.000 --> 46:03.080
Ms. Jiang Li, are you having dinner?

46:03.680 --> 46:04.960
Have you forgotten the family?

46:05.040 --> 46:06.920
Madam Ji is hosting a feast
for you at home

46:07.000 --> 46:08.560
to welcome your return.

46:08.640 --> 46:10.280
Did anybody tell me about that?

46:10.360 --> 46:11.960
I told Bai Xue this afternoon.

46:12.440 --> 46:14.120
Didn't Bai Xue inform you?

46:14.200 --> 46:16.080
You know I'm not at home all day today.

46:16.560 --> 46:18.120
Did you ask a girl to look for me

46:18.200 --> 46:19.600
all over town to deliver a message?

46:19.680 --> 46:21.800
I had no choice, didn't I?

46:21.880 --> 46:25.160
You're always not home.

46:25.240 --> 46:26.240
There's a feast at home,

46:27.080 --> 46:29.000
but you didn't tell me to help.

46:29.520 --> 46:31.120
It's already late

46:31.200 --> 46:32.880
and you're only looking for me now.

46:33.640 --> 46:35.280
Doesn't Mother treat me as family

46:35.360 --> 46:36.560
or did she know

46:36.640 --> 46:39.280
I was going to have a farewell dinner
with the people of Huaixiang,

46:39.360 --> 46:40.680
so she's holding it today?

46:40.760 --> 46:43.920
Ms. Jiang Li, Madam Ji will get upset

46:44.000 --> 46:45.600
if you misinterpret her good intentions.

46:45.680 --> 46:47.000
She worked very hard

46:47.080 --> 46:48.880
to prepare the feast
to welcome your return.

46:49.920 --> 46:51.840
The banquet inside has already begun.

46:51.920 --> 46:54.080
It's really late for Mother
to inform me now.

46:54.160 --> 46:56.120
If I leave now,

46:56.200 --> 46:58.840
people might say
the Jiang family lack manners,

46:58.920 --> 47:00.480
which would ruin my father's reputation.

47:00.560 --> 47:01.640
If that's the case,

47:02.200 --> 47:04.120
I'll go back and inform Madam Ji

47:04.200 --> 47:06.680
that we'll hold a feast
to welcome your return next time.

47:07.440 --> 47:08.560
Thank you, Ms. Sun.
